================================================================================================
  [TEST] PART 11 claims delta N = delta N^i = 0 at linear TT order.  In ya_tensor_exact_2026.py that was SET BY HAND.  Here it is COMPUTED: add a genuine TT polarisation to the same setup and look for linear-in-gamma terms in the phi and B rows.
  [ok]   the added mode is transverse and traceless for k || zhat (delta^ij gamma_ij = 0 and k^i gamma_ij = 0)
