     11/10                       92        True        -1/23
       1/5                        2        True           -2
      1/10                     28/9        True         -9/7
     1/100                   388/99        True       -99/97
  [ok]   *** THE UV LIMIT c_s^2 -> -(lam_K-1)/(3 lam_K-1) IS NEGATIVE ON *BOTH* NO-GHOST BRANCHES (lam_K > 1 AND lam_K < 1/3) -- there is no branch escape ***
         CORRECTION TO MY OWN FIRST DRAFT: I asserted the lam_K < 1/3 branch had a POSITIVE UV limit.  It does not: at lam_K = 1/5 the limit is -2.  The sign flip of (lam-1) is cancelled by the sign flip of (3lam-1), exactly as it is in the no-ghost condition.
